{"file": "我李长生重回八零，赶山狩猎养妻女-第101集.mp4", "ep": 101, "duration": 47.2, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 1.0, "text": "你说的对"}, {"start": 1.58, "end": 3.42, "text": "你们受过反审训练"}, {"start": 3.58, "end": 4.42, "text": "挨打"}, {"start": 4.42, "end": 5.42, "text": "挨饿"}, {"start": 5.42, "end": 6.42, "text": "挨动"}, {"start": 6.42, "end": 7.66, "text": "你们都扛得住"}, {"start": 7.66, "end": 8.86, "text": "知道就好"}, {"start": 10.61, "end": 11.61, "text": "可惜"}, {"start": 11.61, "end": 12.81, "text": "我不是公安"}, {"start": 13.39, "end": 14.59, "text": "我是跑山的"}, {"start": 15.02, "end": 17.02, "text": "这手艺我练了很多年"}, {"start": 17.02, "end": 18.62, "text": "狼皮能留完整"}, {"start": 18.62, "end": 20.62, "text": "人的我还没试过"}, {"start": 20.62, "end": 21.82, "text": "你真是瘋狂"}, {"start": 21.82, "end": 22.62, "text": "不"}, {"start": 22.62, "end": 24.02, "text": "我只问三个问题"}, {"start": 24.02, "end": 26.42, "text": "谁花钱要什么"}, {"start": 26.42, "end": 28.05, "text": "下一步人在哪"}, {"start": 28.05, "end": 29.21, "text": "十"}, {"start": 29.21, "end": 31.1, "text": "九"}, {"start": 31.1, "end": 32.62, "text": "三"}, {"start": 33.14, "end": 34.14, "text": "我说"}, {"start": 34.14, "end": 35.53, "text": "说"}, {"start": 35.53, "end": 37.7, "text": "霍华德财团"}, {"start": 37.7, "end": 39.5, "text": "我们替霍华德财团做事"}, {"start": 39.5, "end": 40.9, "text": "外国财团"}, {"start": 40.9, "end": 42.3, "text": "他们要什么"}, {"start": 42.3, "end": 43.1, "text": "蕴藤"}, {"start": 43.1, "end": 44.7, "text": "大木核心区域里的蕴藤"}, {"start": 44.7, "end": 46.9, "text": "老板相信那东西和长生不老有关"}]}